{"4038890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Total Destruction", "steam_appid": 4038890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5088740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Destruction is a collection of awesome military vehicle moments with focus on satisfying explosions and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/62b42cda1fcd555286e4134b0b8e8cef.poster.avif?t=1786884319\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/62b42cda1fcd555286e4134b0b8e8cef.webm?t=1786884319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/62b42cda1fcd555286e4134b0b8e8cef.mp4?t=1786884319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic destruction - buildings that collapse, vehicles that get ripped apart, ships that break in two (or more!), tank turrets that can fly off, ammo that can detonate or catch fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mayhem mode - a sandbox for going beyond limits. Includes weapon customization so you can do BRRRRRT with a pickup truck or shoot 800mm shells from your tank</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/3b4c29eb854f5a4f90bf5911ee82ef97.poster.avif?t=1786884319\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/3b4c29eb854f5a4f90bf5911ee82ef97.webm?t=1786884319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/3b4c29eb854f5a4f90bf5911ee82ef97.mp4?t=1786884319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helicopters - including 2 tilt-rotor ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighter jets &amp; bombers (nuclear capable)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks, IFV-s, APC-s - including super-heavy P. 1000 Ratte tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artillery &amp; MLRS - including 80-centimetre railway gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships (with lots of cruise missiles waiting to be launched)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies also use car bombs, drones and anti-air weaponry like Shilka and S-300</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/28dce9e27cc549a438f4949b2eda39c9.poster.avif?t=1786884319\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/28dce9e27cc549a438f4949b2eda39c9.webm?t=1786884319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/28dce9e27cc549a438f4949b2eda39c9.mp4?t=1786884319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Destruction is a collection of awesome military vehicle moments with focus on satisfying explosions and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038890/extras/62b42cda1fcd555286e4134b0b8e8cef.poster.avif?t=1786884319\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akama